<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Reasoning Under Uncertainty: Exploring Probabilistic Reasoning Capabilities of LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Independence of Generated Samples</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Reasoning Under Uncertainty: Exploring Probabilistic Reasoning Capabilities of LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Evaluation on Real-world Data</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Reasoning Under Uncertainty: Exploring Probabilistic Reasoning Capabilities of LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Effect of Sample Count in Context</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In Reasoning Under Uncertainty: Exploring Probabilistic Reasoning Capabilities of LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>Access to Code Interpreter</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
